inst/doc
.Rproj.user
/doc/
/Meta/
# dev/ holds tracked development guides, Superpowers documents and study
# sources. Other scratch work remains untracked. Exclude immediate children
# first, then allow the maintained directories and directory guide.
# Large simulation outputs remain local and regenerable.
#
# One exception inside that exception: dev/simstudy/validation-data.rds IS
# tracked. It is the compact bundle the validation article renders from,
# written by export_validation_data.R, and the article cannot build without
# it on a fresh checkout. Kept small on purpose -- the 155k-row per-element
# table is dropped, only the summaries and the occupancy rows are carried.
/dev/*
!/dev/simstudy/
!/dev/parallelisation/
!/dev/superpowers/
!/dev/README.md
/dev/simstudy/results/
# Outputs of make_occupancy_maps.R and occupancy_maps.Rmd. Both regenerate in
# about 90 seconds from the sources beside them, and the rendered report is
# 3.6 MB of embedded figures. The sources are tracked; the outputs are not.
/dev/simstudy/mapdata.rds
/dev/simstudy/occupancy_maps.html
# deprecated/ IS tracked: it is the record of superseded code (occPlus-era
# functions, the old vignette, functions_old.cpp), kept in git and excluded
# from the build via ^deprecated$ in .Rbuildignore. Its existing contents were
# tracked only by grandfathering -- they predate the ignore rule this replaces
# -- which meant anything moved there in future would have been silently
# untracked. That matters because TODO.md group C plans to move more dead
# code here. Nothing is ignored under deprecated/ now.
outputs/caiwang_results.rda
src/*.o
src/*.so
src/*.dll
src/*.dylib
data/data_out_env_trait.rdata
analysis/analysis.R
data/sampledata_orig.rda
data/data_todoug_20260714.csv
data/CaiWang_data/
data/traitdata_caiwang.rdata
traitdata_caiwang.rdata
interim_todo.Rmd
data/sampledata_highp_highthetabaseline.rda
data/sampleresults_highp_highthetabaseline.rda
# Rendered from TODO.md as a parse check; regenerable, never a deliverable.
TODO.html
# pkgdown build output. Regenerated from _pkgdown.yml + the R docs +
# vignettes via pkgdown::build_site(); never a deliverable to commit.
docs
.posit/assistant
/.worktrees/
# Stray graphics device output from headless Rscript calls that plot without
# an explicit device. Never a deliverable.
Rplots.pdf
# Local preview of the GitHub Pages site, written by
# dev/simstudy/lesson-site/build_preview.R; regenerated on every run.
/dev/simstudy/lesson-site/preview/

# Finder metadata is not part of development documentation.
.DS_Store

# Optional MCP outputs when P2A_PROJECT_ROOT is the repository root.
/artifacts/
